# Repo-root .dockerignore — applies to the booth image build (context: repo
# root, see booth/Dockerfile). The operator build uses context: app/, which has
# its own (empty) context root, so this file does not affect it.
#
# node_modules is 90 MB+ and never needed: the SPA is served from the committed
# booth/web/dist, which Go embeds at compile time. Keep it (and VCS/CI cruft)
# out of the build context.
**/node_modules
**/.git
.github
docs
booth/web/src
booth/web/e2e
booth/web/public
